			"name": "Engineer",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Field repair and modification of vehicles and heavy weapons under fire.\n\nDesign: Hard skill; points left generic since this add-on does not know the base template's final IQ, exactly as Imperium/Templates/Astartes Librarian Add-On.gct leaves Meditation and Hidden Lore (the Warp) generic for the same reason.",
			"tags": [
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Mechanicus"
			],
			"specialization": "Combat Engineering",
			"difficulty": "iq/h",
			"points": 8
		},
		{
			"id": "skoiSktOs5D2kMsh4",
			"name": "Engineer",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Astartes power armour maintenance and battlefield repair -- a Chapter's Techmarines are who keep the rest of the company's plate running.\n\nDesign: Hard skill; points as above.",
